Hourly Monitoring: Pickup tab, comma formatting, centered downtime codes, collapsible shifts, summary shift sub tabs, Excel export.

Apply from the project root:
    git apply --whitespace=nowarn hourly-monitoring-pickup.patch      (or: patch -p1 < hourly-monitoring-pickup.patch)
    npm install exceljs
No migrations are needed (Pickup reads the existing tables).

